    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">35 min</span></div>\n  <h1>Constructors, Destructors &amp; Copy Semantics</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">How an object is born, how it dies, and what \"copying\" it really copies. You will know the constructor kinds, the exact order things run in Java and C++, why Java's <code>finalize()</code> is gone while C++ destructors are everywhere, how shallow and deep copies differ, and the rule of three / five / zero that interviewers love to probe.</p>\n"
